instructions:
Desktop:
WASD - move;
E - interact;
Mouse - camera rotate;
M - shop;
J - daily tasks;
H - daily reward;
Tab - show/hide cursor;
P - pause;

Open a restaurant and create a unique design.
Take orders and cook in a realistic kitchen simulator.
Discover new dishes: milkshakes, desserts, snacks.
Improve the kitchen, hire chefs and train staff.
Happy customers = tips + reputation!

PC Controls:
Move — W, A, S, D or Arrow Keys;
Jump — Space;
Run — Shift;
Crouch — C;
Interact — E;
Drop item — R;
Open Menu — Tab;
Zoom Camera — Right Mouse Button (RMB);

Mobile Controls:
Move — Joystick;
Jump — Jump Button;
Run — Run Button;
Drop item - Drop Button;
Crouch — Crouch Button;
Rotate Camera — Right side of the screen;
Interact — Button with the "E" icon;
Open Menu — Button in the top-right corner.

On a mobile device:
- Character rotation - swipe from the right side of the screen;
- Character movement - virtual joystick on the left;
- Interact with items - tap the icon in the center of the screen;
- Menu navigation - tap the buttons.

On a desktop:
- Character rotation - mouse movement;
- Character movement - WASD keys;
- Interact with items - E key or left mouse button;
- Hint - H key;
- Inventory - TAB key.

description:
Motorcycle Racer: Road Mayhem is an exciting motorcycle racing game.
In this game you will become a motorcycle racer who travels through city streets and highways, avoiding collisions with other vehicles. You will be able to unlock faster and more powerful motorcycles, each with its own unique handling characteristics, as well as improve the characteristics of your motorcycle. One of the key features of the game is a realistic physics engine that makes the gameplay challenging and exciting.

Features of the game:
- Bright and colorful graphics;
- Well-developed physics engine;
- Realistic soundtrack.

Get ready for the exciting adventure that awaits you:

• Experience the incredible ragdoll archer physics that will leave you breathless;
• Feel the realistic physics of arrows and armor - each arrow loudly ricochets and bounces, creating unpredictable situations;
• Discover unique arrows with unique gameplay features that will add variety to your game;
• A damage system awaits you, where each part of the body receives a different level of damage, making the game even more realistic;
• Upgrade your hero to become a real master archer;
• Fight interesting opponents and powerful bosses for a real challenge;
• Enjoy beautiful and pleasant graphics, where explosions, sparks and splashes will envelop you like “Fire”;
• Participate in the general ranking of players to show your skills;
• Constantly level up with daily player ratings.

