Girl Hair Salon & Dress Up is a game where you can:

- Use your creativity in hairstyling – offer your clients a variety of options, from trendy cuts to vibrant colors and elegant updos;
- Experiment with makeup and choose fabulous outfits – turn your clients into real fashion icons;
- Get rewards like stickers for your progress – unlock new opportunities for your hair salon and improve your skills as a stylist;
- Take photos of your best works – share your masterpieces with friends and other players.
